applygray.machine.quantum_storage.chest.name=Large Quantum Item Storage Array
applygray.machine.quantum_storage.chest.tooltip.1=Build the structure with up to 54 quantum storage units; each unit adds its tier's independent slot count and capacity to the host.
applygray.machine.quantum_storage.chest.tooltip.2=All stored items exist only inside this host and consume no power.
